  itemDetailsList:
  - itemName: 4
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbc6c86941f95fe44b04e95f280b2819, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: The candle is lighted...
  - itemName: 5
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0eb5a74e5d2b0154a8681a89c3b262cb, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A large, ornate brooch bearing the crest of the Hold family. The pin
      is exceptionally sharp. It is covered in blood.
  - itemName: 6
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: An unsent letter of Admiral Hold filing for divorce from his wife,
      Theodosia. The letter is dated the day before his death. It cites adultery
      as the primary reason for the separation.
  - itemName: 9
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A note from Theodosia to Charles requesting he refrain from dismissing
      the maid and the stable hand in spite of their "scandalous actions."
  - itemName: 10
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: You picked it up!
  - itemName: 11
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A bloody hand is imprinted on the windowsill. A trail of blood then
      runs from the windowsill towards the stables...
  - itemName: 12
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A pair of gloves found in the stables. Once white, now stained red
      by blood. They are monogrammed with the initials "T.H."
  - itemName: 13
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A portrait of the Hold Family. A very large brooch is pinned to the
      Admiral's chest.
  - itemName: 14
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A delicate wooden trellis attached to the side of the house, sitting
      just above a window on the second floor. Several of its crossbars have been
      snapped in two, as though someone attempted to climb it...
  - itemName: 7
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A love letter between Lavender and Dorothy. Testing to see if this
      works!
  - itemName: 8
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A love letter between Lavender and Dorothy. Testing to see if this
      works!
  - itemName: 16
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A door key.
